DRM output on its own VT without root.

Adds --drm-vt=N. When the DRM output starts, it asks logind to switch to
VT N. logind allows this to the user of a local session, and it drops the
DRM master of the compositor on the other VT. mpv needs libsystemd for
the call.

Adds --drm-master-wait=SECONDS. A player without root gets the DRM master
only when no other program holds it. The DRM output opens the card again
until it gets the master, or until the time runs out.

A mode in --drm-mode that the display does not have falls back to the
preferred mode, so that a player can ask for the refresh rate of each
video.

License: the license of mpv.
